{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "1", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "γαῖαν παμμήτειραν ἀείσομαι, ἠυθέμεθλον,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "2", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πρεσβίστην, ἣ φέρβει ἐπὶ χθονὶ πάνθʼ ὁπόσʼ ἐστίν,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "3", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἠμὲν ὅσα χθόνα δῖαν ἐπέρχεται ἠδʼ ὅσα πόντον"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "4", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἠδʼ ὅσα πωτῶνται, τάδε φέρβεται ἐκ σέθεν ὄλβου."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "5", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἐκ σέο δʼ εὔπαιδές τε καὶ εὔκαρποι τελέθουσι,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "6", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πότνια, σεῦ δʼ ἔχεται δοῦναι βίον ἠδʼ ἀφελέσθαι"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "7", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "θνητοῖς ἀνθρώποισιν· ὃ δʼ ὄλβιος, ὅν κε σὺ θυμῷ"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "8", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πρόφρων τιμήσῃς· τῷ τʼ ἄφθονα πάντα πάρεστι."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "9", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "βρίθει μέν σφιν ἄρουρα φερέσβιος ἠδὲ κατʼ ἀγροὺς"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "10", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κτήνεσιν εὐθηνεῖ, οἶκος δʼ ἐμπίπλαται ἐσθλῶν·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "11", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αὐτοὶ δʼ εὐνομίῃσι πόλιν κάτα καλλιγύναικα"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "12", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κοιρανέουσʼ, ὄλβος δὲ πολὺς καὶ πλοῦτος ὀπηδεῖ·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "13", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παῖδες δʼ εὐφροσύνῃ νεοθηλέι κυδιόωσι"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "14", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παρθενικαί τε χοροῖς πολυανθέσιν εὔφρονι θυμῷ"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "15", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "παίζουσαι σκαίρουσι κατʼ ἄνθεα μαλθακὰ ποίης,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "16", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οὕς κε σὺ τιμήσῃς, σεμνὴ θεά, ἄφθονε δαῖμον."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "17", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "χαῖρε, θεῶν μήτηρ, ἄλοχʼ Οὐρανοῦ ἀστερόεντος,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "18", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πρόφρων δʼ ἀντʼ ᾠδῆς βίοτον θυμήρεʼ ὄπαζε·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.in-tellurem-matrem-omnium", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "19", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "αὐτὰρ ἐγὼ καὶ σεῖο καὶ ἄλλης μνήσομʼ ἀοιδῆς."}
